    <string name="settings_dashboard_description">Reads FX11 vehicle data without CarPlay. Local instruments take priority over Ultra and the full-screen map. The map connection setting applies on the next CarPlay connection.</string>
    <string name="settings_dashboard_mode_hint">MODE turns the three-screen animation on/off, switching between the original instruments and custom dashboard. Learn the RESET button below: Midnight and Classic cycle music → navigation → tire pressure; Panorama switches music / tire pressure while keeping the map. Each style remembers its selection. All three hide navigation instructions when no route is active. Vehicle readings work without CarPlay. A gray lane-centering icon means inactive or unknown; green requires confirmed engagement.</string>
